WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:00.880
I called in sick

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.860
on Friday so I could

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.170
go to a baseball game.

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.600
I coughed into the phone

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.990
as hard as I could.

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:07.770
"Boss, I can barely

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:08.660
get out of bed."

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.230
He sighed. "Get some rest.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.170
We'll manage." I hung up,

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.020
grinning like a genius.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.400
An hour later, I was

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.250
in the stands in my

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.560
lucky jersey, hot dog in hand.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:20.560
In the fifth inning,

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.750
the big screen lit up

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:22.650
with the Fan Cam,

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.240
and the crowd roared.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.140
The camera swept past a kid,

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.810
past a grandma, and then

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.920
landed on me: mouth stuffed

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.110
with hot dog, waving

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.690
a giant foam finger.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.990
Everybody cheered. I waved back

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.000
like a celebrity.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.630
Then I noticed the man

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:39.020
sitting right behind me,

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:40.520
waving at the camera too.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:41.920
Hawaiian shirt.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.330
Giant beer.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:44.590
My boss.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.060
We locked eyes.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.410
My foam finger slowly dropped.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.490
For ten whole seconds,

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.960
neither of us breathed.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:53.560
Then I ducked behind

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:54.360
my hot dog.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.580
On Monday morning,

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:56.740
I walked into the office

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.230
with my heart pounding.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.310
There was a sticky note

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:00.200
on my desk:

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.440
"You didn't see me.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:02.640
I didn't see you.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:03.720
Feel better soon."

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.220
At the 9 AM meeting,

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.410
my boss stood up.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:07.690
"Great news, team.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.560
Starting this month, everyone gets

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.240
one extra personal day."

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.490
He glanced at me.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.140
"Just stay away from

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.100
the Fan Cam."
